# require(*) gives every table, and the SQL door of the meta database reads the release of the zone data
** spec: library/meta.md#loading-the-tables
** @meta require(*)
from lib/meta use (meta);
primary aspect e157_test3 is
  process main is
    print meta.info("tzdata");
  return;
end e157_test3;
